Origin
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package was extracted from the Swift port of AndroidX Palette originally
written for Camper (ios/iosApp/ArtworkPalette.swift in iheanyi/coda-android).
The Camper-specific image loading, caching and SwiftUI view code was not
carried over; only the palette math, contrast helpers and semantic role
derivation are included here.
